{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-11-13T08:29:05.717Z","type":"exp.start","exp":"E-PAYRUN-MAKER-CHECKER-01","attempt":1,"title":"Maker-checker for pay runs: a run that names an approver is not signed until that different account approves that exact run","tier":"offline","hypothesis":"Predictions are in docs/lab/PROGRAMME_PLAN.md, committed before this file existed. Without an approver a pay run signs as before; with one, the room refuses to sign until the approver, a different account, signs an approval bound to the round, the run id and the order hash with a key that belongs to the approver's account; the approver's sealed summary matches the run; and approval and signing each happen once.","limits":["Offline, on a local room with a simulated attestation provider and a stubbed account-key check. The contract does not check the approval; the room does."],"requires":[],"chain_prev":"4f0348380ffe007f8d89ee97cf71d16ea81f0e2110d8587243be70b684ddb598","chain_hash":"120f260b7270307bd6a6a3dfe135f9a47dca139a06b6fb26f1c221692e177322"}
